  "description": "Curious Science! Elementary School Experiment Quiz is a fun and educational quiz game based on science experiments and observations taught in elementary school.\n\nExplore familiar topics like water, air, light, magnets, plants, and electricity through easy-to-play quiz questions. Some answers may seem obvious at first, but the results can be surprisingly tricky.\n\nWhy does this happen? What will the experiment show? As you play, each question helps turn curiosity into understanding.\n\nPerfect for kids, families, and anyone who enjoys learning through play, this game makes science feel approachable, exciting, and rewarding.\n\nDiscover, think, and say “Aha!” with every answer!",
